     "body": "<p><a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=557058%3A24c578cc-15e9-4649-9f68-5eace85735e0\" class=\"user-hover\" rel=\"557058:24c578cc-15e9-4649-9f68-5eace85735e0\" data-account-id=\"557058:24c578cc-15e9-4649-9f68-5eace85735e0\" accountid=\"557058:24c578cc-15e9-4649-9f68-5eace85735e0\" rel=\"noreferrer\">A. Soroka</a>, could you please add more detail to this ticket so that someone besides yourself could potentially work it. Otherwise, you are welcome to close it.</p>",
